        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Battle of Guandu</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Date</span><span class="info-stat-val">200 CE; the siege of Guandu ran from the eighth to the tenth month</span></div>
